  "date": "2013-10",
  "title": "Ides Stud Ides Software Licencing Updates",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "New from IDES June to September 2013:",
      "text": "- Corel PaintShop ProX6 for Windows in several languages, free of charge\n\n- RealVNC 5.0.5 for Windows, Mac and Linux/Unix in English at Fr. 5.-/license/year\n\n- GIS-Software Erdas Imagine 2013 (V13.0) for Windows in English at Fr. 500.-/license/year\n\n- IBM SPSS Floating 22 for Windows, Mac and Linux as multilingual package, free of charge\n\n- IBM SPSS Node 22 for Windows, Mac and Linux as multilingual package at Fr. 50.-/license/year\n\n- EndNote X7 for Mac OS X in English at Fr. 30.-/license\n\n- Parallels Desktop Version 8 for Mac OS X in English at Fr. 35.-/license/year\n\n- LabView 13 Windows, Mac and Linux in English, free of charge\n\n- CorelDraw Technical Suite X6 for Windows in several languages at Fr. 20.-/license/year\n\n- Logic Pro X 10 for Mac OS X in several languages at Fr. 65.-/license/year\n\n- Data visualization software Tecplot 360 2013R1for Windows, Mac OS X and Unix/Linux in English at Fr. 100.-/license/year\n\n- EndNote X7 for Windows in English at Fr. 30.-/license\n\n- Active directory integration tool Quest Authentication Services Version 4 for Mac OS X and Linux/Unix in English, free of charge\n\n- Bookends 12 for Mac OS X in English, free of charge\n\n- New ETH corporate design font, ETH Font FF DIN Pro for Fr. 10.-/license/year\n\nFor details regarding home use of ETH licenced software see www.id.ethz.ch/services/list/einkauf/heimnutzung_EN ."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Staffnet",
      "text": "Mehr Informationen zu den Informatik-Dienstleistungen auf www.id.ethz.ch und auch im ID-Blog blogs.ethz.ch/id ."
    }
  ],
